# Build outputs
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

# Visual Studio / VS Code
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo

# Local runtime data — never commit real device secrets or user data
**/secureapp.db3
**/secureapp.db3-*
**/securestorage.dat
relay/SecureApp.Relay/data/
relay/SecureApp.Relay/*.db3

# Android release signing key (2026-09-10) — never commit the private key or its password; losing
# this file means every future release build gets a NEW signature, and Android refuses to install
# an update over an existing install signed with a different key (full uninstall would be needed on
# every device). Keep a backup of this directory somewhere safe outside the repo.
keystore/

# OS cruft
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# NuGet
*.nupkg
packages/
